                        "_title": "Deliverables",
                        "_element_id": "service-scope",
                        "_css_classes": "gp-deliverables",
                        "editor": "<ul>\n<li>Ebook and Kindle formatting with navigation and a table of contents appropriate to the content</li>\n<li>Paperback and hardcover interior layouts at the agreed trim size</li>\n<li>Front matter, chapter styles, page numbering and image placement</li>\n<li>Print-ready interior PDFs and ebook-ready files in the agreed formats</li>\n<li>KDP-ready file preparation, agreed revisions and a clear handover</li>\n</ul>"
